bergin/animalcell.jpg</a><sup class=\"noprint Inline-Template\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">[<span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span title=\"\" class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Link_rot\">dead link</a></span></span>]</span></sup></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.npc.edu/Bio105/media/m1_l6-01.gif\">http://www.npc.edu/Bio105/media/m1_l6-01.gif</a><sup class=\"noprint Inline-Template\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">[<span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span title=\"\"> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://web.archive.org/web/20030329065917/http://www.npc.edu/Bio105/media/m1_l6-01.gif\">dead link </a></span></span>]</span></sup></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.csus.edu/indiv/l/loom/animal%20cell.jpg\">http://www.csus.edu/indiv/l/loom/animal%20cell.jpg</a><sup class=\"noprint Inline-Template\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">[<span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span title=\"\"> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://web.archive.org/web/20060525133344/http://www.csus.edu/indiv/l/loom/animal%20cell.jpg\">dead link </a></span></span>]</span></sup></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.rkm.com.au/CELL/cellimages/cellannot700.jpg\">http://www.rkm.com.au/CELL/cellimages/cellannot700.jpg</a>].</li></ul>\nThere are some structures I did not add because it was not clear to me how they should look. For all have doubts between cytoskeleton, microfibers and microtubules. If you would like to make another language version of it, message me and I can make an image without text for you or message me the names in the language you want them to appear.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2006-04","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"Own work using Adobe Illustr